## Gate фазы 5 (строки GATE из uv run pytest -q -s; тесты — tests/billing/)
[x] двойная отправка одного платежа → одно списание — test_cash.py::test_cash_confirm_settles_saga_and_is_idempotent (1 PAID, 1 attempt), test_online.py::test_checkout_twice_creates_one_provider_intent (create_calls == 1)
GATE I-6: UPDATE/DELETE PAID payment rejected by trigger app.payment_guard
GATE secrets: 0 provider secrets / card numbers in captured logs, payment_attempt, audit_log, webhook_inbox
GATE provider timeout: create_calls=1, status_calls≥1, saga PAYMENT_PENDING_VERIFICATION → PAID via status()
GATE barrier failure after payment: payment PAID kept, no refund, saga MANUAL_REVIEW
GATE reconciliation: 5 kinds found, full report stored, MISSING_LOCAL→payment created, STATUS_MISMATCH→pulled, MISSING_REMOTE kept
GATE refund > amount: code → 422 (refundable=800000); DB trigger → CheckViolationError; REFUNDED derived
GATE webhook ×5: one PAID, one confirmed event, identical responses
GATE bad signature: -32504, audit WEBHOOK_REJECTED (actor PROVIDER)
GATE duplicate provider payment: second PAID payment + DUPLICATE_REMOTE discrepancy (refund queue)
GATE orphan webhook: ORPHAN → APPLIED after payment appeared, one confirmed event
[x] сумма, присланная клиентом и отличная от посчитанной → отказ — test_cash.py::test_declared_amount_mismatch_is_refused (422 AMOUNT_MISMATCH, платёж остался PENDING)
[x] property-based: сумма всех возвратов никогда не превышает сумму платежа — test_refunds.py::test_property_refund_sum_never_exceeds_payment (hypothesis, 300 примеров) + test_property_refund_sum_in_database (случайные последовательности против триггера)
[x] вебхук с неверной подписью отклонён, попытка в аудите — см. GATE bad signature; Click: sign_string → error -1 (test_webhooks.py::test_click_prepare_complete_*)

